{"title": "Ask HN: How are you protecting your apps and infra after recent vulnerabilities?", "link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50349058", "summary": "<p>Recently, there has been a rise in major security incidents, hacks, and zero-day vulnerabilities.<p>Are you actively doing something to prevent your systems from being exploited, and how are you ensuring you haven't already suffered a data breach?<p>To be honest, I'm scrambling my head thinking about all the possibilities, and it's making me a bit anxious.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50349058\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50349058</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 1</p>", "published": "2026-11-03T07:21:44+00:00", "source": "Hacker News Best", "category": "techblog", "matched_entities": {}, "ontology": {"repo": "BlogRadar", "category": "techblog", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "source_event_model": "blog_post", "event_model_id": "tech.blog_post", "evidence_policy_ids": ["source_metadata", "article_text"], "event_model_payload": {"headline": "Ask HN: How are you protecting your apps and infra after recent vulnerabilities?", "source_name": "Hacker News Best", "source_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50349058", "published_at": "2026-11-03T07:21:44+00:00", "summary": "<p>Recently, there has been a rise in major security incidents, hacks, and zero-day vulnerabilities.<p>Are you actively doing something to prevent your systems from being exploited, and how are you ensuring you haven't already suffered a data breach?<p>To be honest, I'm scrambling my head thinking about all the possibilities, and it's making me a bit anxious.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50349058\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50349058</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 1</p>"}}, "logged_at": "2026-11-03T07:37:23.632757+00:00"}
